  "id": "frustration-tolerance",
  "term": "frustration tolerance",
  "definition": "Frustration tolerance is a person’s ability to deal positively with adversity, blocked goals, or unmet needs. It reflects how well someone can stay constructive after failure and how willing they are to keep taking on challenges.",
